>> title: Coleslaw
>> category: Dressings & Dips
>> tags: cabbage, mayonnaise, side, salad, no-cook
>> counters: Smokehouse, Deli, Meat and Three
>> aka: white slaw, cole slaw, creamy slaw, slaw, cabbage salad
>> servings: 8
>> time: 1 hr 45 min
>> pairs-with: smoked-chicken

>> step: salt and drain 30 min
Toss @green cabbage{2%lb}(900 g; shredded), @carrot{1%large}(grated), and @yellow onion{2%Tbs}(grated) with @kosher salt{1%Tbs} in a #colander{} and leave them to ~drain{30%min}.

>> step: whisk the dressing
Whisk @mayonnaise{3/4%cup}(180 mL), @cider vinegar{2%Tbs}, @granulated sugar{2%Tbs}(25 g), @dry mustard{1%tsp}, @celery seed{1%tsp}, and @black pepper{1/2%tsp} smooth.

>> step: toss
Toss @&(~2)drained cabbage{} with @&(~1)dressing{}.

>> step: chill 1 hr
Chill @&(~1)slaw{} for ~chill{1%hr} before serving.
